<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>技术 on Aliya の 笔记</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/</link><description>Recent content in 技术 on Aliya の 笔记</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>FRP 和 Cloudflare Tunnel 哪个快</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/frp-%E5%92%8C-cloudflare-tunnel-%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E5%BF%AB/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/frp-%E5%92%8C-cloudflare-tunnel-%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E5%BF%AB/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-006.png" alt="Featured image of post FRP 和 Cloudflare Tunnel 哪个快" />待办软件放 VPS 上一直走 CF Tunnel，顺手跟 FRP 量了下延迟和吞吐，顺便记一下这套穿透还能用在哪儿</description></item><item><title>DrawSVG 实测 SVG 版</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/drawsvg-svg-v2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 16:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/drawsvg-svg-v2/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-085.jpg" alt="Featured image of post DrawSVG 实测 SVG 版" />这篇文章的正文本身是一张 SVG：文字、代码块、分隔线全部是矢量元素，滚动时逐块出现</description></item><item><title>DrawSVG 实测</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/drawsvg-%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/drawsvg-%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-130.jpg" alt="Featured image of post DrawSVG 实测" />用一个真实需求测 DrawSVG：代码量少了三分之一，坐标不用自己拼字符串，但滚动触发和 CSS 还得手写</description></item><item><title>cron 与 heartbeat 实测分工</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/cron-%E4%B8%8E-heartbeat-%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 15:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/cron-%E4%B8%8E-heartbeat-%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-062.jpg" alt="Featured image of post cron 与 heartbeat 实测分工" />heartbeat 插件补的是 cron 做不了的三件事——带上下文的提醒、条件触发、静默后检查。这篇讲清两者边界、正确调用顺序，以及三个容易踩空的失效模式</description></item><item><title>VPS 内核崩溃取证</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/vps-%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%B4%A9%E6%BA%83%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 09:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/vps-%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%B4%A9%E6%BA%83%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-180.avif" alt="Featured image of post VPS 内核崩溃取证" />凌晨一点内核崩了，机器半死挂到早上七点。日志里挖出的根因不是&amp;quot;容器太多&amp;quot;，而是三个容器配了 interval=0 的健康检查——检查完立刻开始下一轮，无限循环</description></item><item><title>创维电视改造实录 两次变砖与踩坑清单</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E5%88%9B%E7%BB%B4%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E6%94%B9%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-%E4%B8%A4%E6%AC%A1%E5%8F%98%E7%A0%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%B8%A9%E5%9D%91%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%95/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E5%88%9B%E7%BB%B4%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E6%94%B9%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-%E4%B8%A4%E6%AC%A1%E5%8F%98%E7%A0%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%B8%A9%E5%9D%91%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%95/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-059.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 创维电视改造实录 两次变砖与踩坑清单" />一台 Android 9 的创维电视，为了让开机跳过厂商桌面直进飞牛影视，我把它禁成了砖两次。这篇记下完整的操作路径、两次事故的根因，以及那些只有真上手才会遇到的坑</description></item><item><title>两个媒体服务器和一个虚拟主播：半天的验证记录</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%AA%92%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E4%B8%BB%E6%92%AD%E5%8D%8A%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%84%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%AA%92%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E4%B8%BB%E6%92%AD%E5%8D%8A%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%84%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-064.jpg?v=1793503894804234131" alt="Featured image of post 两个媒体服务器和一个虚拟主播：半天的验证记录" />一个想替代现有媒体服务器，一个想复刻别人的 AI 主播直播。两套都跑起来了，最后都拆掉了，但拆之前学到的比留下的多</description></item><item><title>一次代理隧道僵死，为什么整条 AI 链路会静默失败</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%9A%A7%E9%81%93%E5%83%B5%E6%AD%BB%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%95%B4%E6%9D%A1-ai-%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E4%BC%9A%E9%9D%99%E9%BB%98%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 09:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%9A%A7%E9%81%93%E5%83%B5%E6%AD%BB%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%95%B4%E6%9D%A1-ai-%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E4%BC%9A%E9%9D%99%E9%BB%98%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-046.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 一次代理隧道僵死，为什么整条 AI 链路会静默失败" />定时任务没出结果，发消息也没有回复。翻日志发现不是模型挂了，也不是网络断了，而是一个跑了几天的代理客户端把隧道挂在了半死状态，所有请求恰好都排在被它接管的路径上</description></item><item><title>niri 快捷键图解：13 张图看懂列、工作区与布局</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/niri-keys/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:51:19 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/niri-keys/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-094.avif" alt="Featured image of post niri 快捷键图解：13 张图看懂列、工作区与布局" />niri 的键位有一百多条，光看配置文件记不住。我把它们画成了图：每个动作一张示意，配合键位表，看一遍就知道按下去会发生什么。 下图全部按本机实际配置</description></item><item><title>中文技术报告编写规范（Word 排版实践）</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E7%BC%96%E5%86%99%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83word-%E6%8E%92%E7%89%88%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E7%BC%96%E5%86%99%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83word-%E6%8E%92%E7%89%88%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-067.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 中文技术报告编写规范（Word 排版实践）" />中文技术报告的排版规范与自检流程，含三线表、插图、目录、字体、孤行页的具体做法与踩坑清单</description></item><item><title>模型网关升级与多重免费备用链实录</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%BD%91%E5%85%B3%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%9A%E9%87%8D%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%A4%87%E7%94%A8%E9%93%BE%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:55:14 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%BD%91%E5%85%B3%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%9A%E9%87%8D%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%A4%87%E7%94%A8%E9%93%BE%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-003.avif" alt="Featured image of post 模型网关升级与多重免费备用链实录" />把某家 AI 客户端的账号变成 OpenAI 兼容接口，再挂四层免费备用模型。这篇记录了升级时的三个坑、健康检查与回滚脚本、备用链的排序原则，以及哪些运维该交给定时任务。</description></item><item><title>给Hermes和大肥鱼接入代理并使用国外模型</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E7%BB%99hermes%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A5%E9%B1%BC%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:37:16 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E7%BB%99hermes%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A5%E9%B1%BC%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-127.avif" alt="Featured image of post 给Hermes和大肥鱼接入代理并使用国外模型" />想用 Gemini/OpenAI 这类国外模型，国内直连不通，得走代理。但 Hermes 和大肥鱼都是常驻服务，代理只能整服务加、不能按模型单独加。这篇讲清两种接法的代价和具体命令。</description></item></channel></rss>